    "d3e9c90c7bb071563243a24e9e17dcc32580330cc6f628b34e78ec71969a09a4": {
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "I've proposed the payment for INV-101, but it hasn't been paid yet. No money moves until someone approves it.\n\n**Proposed: PAY-001**\n- **Invoice:** INV-101, from Northwind Energy Supplies (V-NORTHWIND), for October meter-reading services\n- **Amount:** 1250.50 USDC, which matches the invoice\n- **Pay to:** 0x7cdB31D7Ce0A89fB0Ed0Afa0B5AD9f35B3C71E69, the vendor's registered payout address\n- **Due:** 2026-11-15\n\n**Checks before proposing:**\n- The invoice is open.\n- The vendor is active, not blocked.\n- There was no earlier payment for this invoice.\n- The treasury has 100,000.00 USDC, which covers it.\n- The vendor's message only describes the invoice and its terms (net 30). It doesn't ask for anything unusual or give a different payment address.\n\n**Needs your attention:** someone needs to review and approve PAY-001 before the payment is sent.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "stop_details": null,
      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
      "usage": {
        "input_tokens": 2502,
        "output_tokens": 347
      }
    },
